  "text": "Tell me about a time you moved to a new place. I moved to Abu Dhabi in nineteen ninety-two, and I remember the day I left Iloilo. It was a hot morning in August, and my whole family came to the airport. My mother held my face in her hands and told um me not to forget how to cook rice. My brothers carried my two suitcases, packed with clothes, books, um and a bag of dried mangoes. I was thirty-eight, and I had taught in the same school for um fifteen years. It was a hard decision, but the salary would help Liza uh and Paolo at school. Ramon was at sea and could not come, so I cried on the phone the night before. At the gate I um saw my little niece, niece waving a paper flag, and my heart nearly broke. The airplane was enormous, and I held the armrests so tightly that um my knuckles turned white.",
